          "reason": "Production retains both the source subscription's unacknowledged messages at snapshot creation and every later message published to the topic, and permits applying that snapshot to a newly created subscription on the topic. fireemu restores both messages. The pinned official emulator accepts the same create, publish, delete, create, seek, and pull sequence but returns no messages."
