          "documents": "README.md, \"Pub/Sub\"; capability manifest PUBSUB-WIRE-1 (crates/fireemu/src/capabilities.json)",
          "reason": "After a subscription is seeked to a timestamp before a message was published, fireemu redelivers that message even though it was already acknowledged and the subscription did not set retainAckedMessages. fireemu retains acked messages for seek unconditionally; the official emulator retains them only when retainAckedMessages is true, so it does not replay here. This is a fireemu superset: a seek never sees fewer messages than the official emulator returns."
        }
